Attribution: this software implements the OpenClaims specification v0.1
as published at https://github.com/openclaims-ai/openclaims (schema and
conformance fixtures vendored under vendor/openclaims/, pinned at commit
3bd7f0ba17f27a23e1652b39d6f65f2972b99d43; see vendor/openclaims/PROVENANCE.md).
The core implementation is clean-room: derived from the specification and
fixture behavior, not copied from the reference TypeScript SDK.
